graph LR
    SF["SourceFile"] --> T1["Transform 1"]
    T1 --> T2["Transform 2"]
    T2 --> T3["Transform N"]
    T3 --> PRINT["Printer"]
    PRINT --> OUTPUT["输出 JS"]
```

